The greatest love story ever told.

2
00:05:17,142 --> 00:05:23,142
Cinderella is a family, fantasy, animation film directed by Clyde Geronimi.

3
00:07:55,714 --> 00:08:01,714
Cinderella has faith her dreams of a better life will come true.

4
00:10:34,285 --> 00:10:40,285
With help from her loyal mice friends and a wave of her Fairy Godmother's wand, Cinderella's
rags are magically turned into a glorious gown and off she goes to the Royal Ball.

5
00:13:12,857 --> 00:13:18,857
But when the clock strikes midnight, the spell is
broken, leaving a single glass slipper...

6
